flowchart TD
    Query[User request]
    Week8[Week 8 SQL text generator]
    Extract[Heuristic SQL-block extraction]
    Risk[Keyword risk analyzer]
    Approval{Approval required?}
    CLI[Terminal yes or no prompt]
    Rejected[Return rejected message]
    Simulated[Print simulated execution message]
    Response[Return generated response]

    Query --> Week8
    Week8 --> Extract
    Extract --> Risk
    Risk --> Approval
    Approval -->|No| Simulated
    Approval -->|Yes| CLI
    CLI -->|Rejected| Rejected
    CLI -->|Approved| Simulated
    Simulated --> Response

    note1[No SQL is executed and no approval decision is stored]
    note1 -.-> Simulated
